Version 1.2.1, Modwerk's port of irpina's 1.2 to run on Elekloader Core 2.1, as sumedho
ported 1.1 (Modwerk's Machine Pages 1.2, 2026-10-14):
- pages.c reads a machine descriptor's UI tail directly instead of calling
  Core 3.0's core_machine_ui();
- fw_active_track, fw_kit (pages.c), fw_voice_params (src.c) and fw_track_blocks
  (pages.s) come from build.json's per-OS cflags and defsym instead of Core 3.0's
  exports;
- params.c ends with four symbols for parts of mp_legacy_tables (+64, +228, +392,
  +600), which mod.json's keep2 sites reach by addend: build.json's sites name a
  symbol without one, and its keep2 sites are plain jsr, lea and guarded bytes.
Nothing else is changed. Stock preconditions are hashes only.
